{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "5968c19d-98cd-8ad4-b956-6646c550117e",
  "created_at": "2026-02-25T12:49:14-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Samir F. Goldberg",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:46:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:46:06-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Yes, I have tree down at my house. It is blocking my driveway. I need to know who I call for this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:46:16-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sorry about that. A tree down in your driveway. Is that a tree on your property, or did it come from somewhere else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:46:26-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is on the property, I think. Big branch, and also top of tree. It came after the wind, last weekend's nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday. I rent here, so I am not owner. Is it city, or owner, or electric company who handles?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:46:44-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. So generally, if it's on private property, it's the property owner's responsibility to deal with it. The city handles trees in the street or on city land, like the right of way. And if it's touching a power line, that's the utility, you'd call them right away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:47:04-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no wires. I looked. Wires are not touching. Only driveway and little bit of the fence."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:47:12-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. And you said you rent. So your landlord would be the one to call about getting it cleared. Do you have a number for them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:47:24-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I have. I will call him today. But if tree is partly on sidewalk, then it is city?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:47:32-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If any of it is out in the street or across the public sidewalk, we can look at that part. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:47:42-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Twenty-five Gidley Street. Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:47:45-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Twenty-five Gidley Street. Is any part of it over the sidewalk or the road?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:47:52-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Sorry, one second, I have flour on hands. I am making pie crust, I put phone on counter. Okay. No, not on sidewalk. Only the driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:48:04-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. So it's all on the private side then. In that case it's your landlord to arrange the removal, and if a branch is hanging over the sidewalk later, call us back. Do you want me to note it anyway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:48:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please note. In case it moves or something falls on street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:48:27-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. I'll put down twenty-five Gidley, tree down in the driveway from the weekend storm, private property, no wires involved. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:48:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct. Can I give phone number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:48:41-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:48:43-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-nine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:48:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-nine. Got it. If anything changes, like it shifts toward the road, call us back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:48:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So I call landlord for tree, electric company only if wires, and city only if street or sidewalk. Yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:49:02-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's exactly it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:49:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Thank you. That is all I need."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:49:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Enjoy your pie. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:49:12-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
